class=\"uk-button uk-button-small uk-button-primary\" href=\"/es/hoteles-con-encanto\" data-tm-hotel-book=\"\"> Reserva aquí</a></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t</li>\n\n\n\t\n\t<li id=\"tm-image-9488\">\n\n\t\t<!-- background: image or video -->\n\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"LLAVES REGALO\" data-src=\"https://rusticae.es/images/webkit/image/9488-image-full.jpg?1783419788\" data-width=\"\" data-height=\"\" uk-cover uk-img=\"target: !* -*, !* +*\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<!-- overlay + content -->\n\t\t<div class=\"uk-overlay uk-position-cover tm-overlay-light-opaque\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uk-position-center uk-text-center  uk-padding-small tm-slideshow-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uk-transition-slide-bottom-small uk-margin-remove-last-child uk-text-left uk-margin-remove-last-child\" style=\"max-width: 480px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uk-h3\">REGALA UNA ESCAPADA</div>\r\n<p>Personaliza tu Llave Regalo Rusticae y sorprende con una escapada única en nuestra selección de hoteles con encanto en España y Portugal.</p>\r\n<div class=\"tm-heading-bg-secondary-no\"><a class=\"uk-button uk-button-small uk-button-primary\" href=\"/es/tarjeta-regalo\">¡QUIERO UNA LLAVE REGALO!</a></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t</li>\n\n\n\t\n\t<li id=\"tm-image-9553\">\n\n\t\t<!-- background: image or video -->\n\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"ALOJAMIENTO DESTACADO\" data-src=\"https://rusticae.es/images/webkit/image/9553-image-full.jpg?1789036234\" data-width=\"\" data-height=\"\" uk-cover uk-img=\"target: !* -*, !* +*\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<!-- overlay + content -->\n\t\t<div class=\"uk-overlay uk-position-cover tm-overlay-light-opaque\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uk-position-center uk-text-center  uk-padding-small tm-slideshow-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uk-transition-slide-bottom-small uk-margin-remove-last-child uk-text-left uk-margin-remove-last-child\" style=\"max-width: 480px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uk-h3\">CORTIJO ALMAZARA EL TORO</div>\r\n<p>Sumérgete en la arquitectura y el oleoturismo de este hotel boutique Rusticae diseñado para desconectar con todos los sentidos.</p>\r\n<div class=\"tm-heading-bg-secondary-no\"><a class=\"uk-button uk-button-small uk-button-primary\" href=\"https://rusticae.es/hotel/cortijo-la-almazara-la-organic\">¡Reserva tu escapada!</a></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t</li>\n\n\n\t\n\t<li id=\"tm-image-9489\">\n\n\t\t<!-- background: image or video -->\n\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"EXPERIENCIAS\" data-src=\"https://rusticae.es/images/webkit/image/9489-image-full.jpg?1779272746\" data-width=\"\" data-height=\"\" uk-cover uk-img=\"target: !* -*, !* +*\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<!-- overlay + content -->\n\t\t<div class=\"uk-overlay uk-position-cover tm-overlay-light-opaque\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uk-position-center uk-text-center  uk-padding-small tm-slideshow-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uk-transition-slide-bottom-small uk-margin-remove-last-child uk-text-left uk-margin-remove-last-child\" style=\"max-width: 480px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uk-h3\">¡ENRÉDATE EN LO LOCAL!</div>\r\n<div class=\"tm-heading-bg-secondary-no\"><a class=\"uk-button uk-button-small uk-button-primary\" href=\"/es/experiencias\">Descubre las experiencias Rusticae</a></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t</li>\n\n\n\t\n\t<li id=\"tm-image-9568\">\n\n\t\t<!-- background: image or video -->\n\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"LLAVES REGALO EXPERIENCIAS 15\" data-src=\"https://rusticae.es/images/webkit/image/9568-image-full.jpg?1784187951\" data-width=\"\" data-height=\"\" uk-cover uk-img=\"target: !* -*, !ul > :first-child\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<!-- overlay + content -->\n\t\t<div class=\"uk-overlay uk-position-cover tm-overlay-light-opaque\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uk-position-center uk-text-center  uk-padding-small tm-slideshow-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uk-transition-slide-bottom-small uk-margin-remove-last-child uk-text-left uk-margin-remove-last-child\" style=\"m